<view class="page"><view class="section-title">{{role==='admin'?'人员排班':'我的空闲时间'}}</view><view class="card"><view wx:if="{{role==='admin'}}"><text class="label">教练</text><picker range="{{therapists}}" range-key="name" value="{{therapistIndex}}" bindchange="therapistChange"><view class="picker">{{therapists[therapistIndex].name}}</view></picker></view><text class="label">具体日期</text><picker mode="date" value="{{date}}" bindchange="dateChange"><view class="picker">{{date}}</view></picker><view class="hint">只有具体日期空闲段会开放预约；已有预约冲突由系统拒绝修改。</view><view wx:for="{{ranges}}" wx:key="index" class="row"><picker mode="time" value="{{item.start}}" data-key="ranges" data-field="start" data-index="{{index}}" bindchange="changeTime"><view class="picker">{{item.start}}</view></picker><text>至</text><picker mode="time" value="{{item.end}}" data-key="ranges" data-field="end" data-index="{{index}}" bindchange="changeTime"><view class="picker">{{item.end}}</view></picker><text class="strong" data-key="ranges" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="removeRange">删除</text></view><button class="btn btn-secondary" data-key="ranges" bindtap="addRange">增加空闲段</button><button class="btn" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving}}" bindtap="save">保存此日空闲时间</button></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">常规排班填充</view><view class="hint">仅填充所选范围内尚未设置的日期，已有设置会跳过。</view><text class="label">每周工作日</text><view class="wrap"><view wx:for="{{weekdays}}" wx:key="value" class="chip {{item.checked?'chip-on':''}}" data-day="{{item.value}}" bindtap="toggleDay">{{item.label}}</view></view><text class="label">默认空闲段</text><view wx:for="{{templateRanges}}" wx:key="index" class="row"><picker mode="time" value="{{item.start}}" data-key="templateRanges" data-field="start" data-index="{{index}}" bindchange="changeTime"><view class="picker">{{item.start}}</view></picker><text>至</text><picker mode="time" value="{{item.end}}" data-key="templateRanges" data-field="end" data-index="{{index}}" bindchange="changeTime"><view class="picker">{{item.end}}</view></picker><text class="strong" data-key="templateRanges" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="removeRange">删除</text></view><button class="btn btn-secondary" data-key="templateRanges" bindtap="addRange">增加默认段</button><text class="label">填充日期范围</text><view class="row"><picker mode="date" value="{{startDate}}" bindchange="startDateChange"><view class="picker">{{startDate}}</view></picker><text>至</text><picker mode="date" value="{{endDate}}" bindchange="endDateChange"><view class="picker">{{endDate}}</view></picker></view><button class="btn" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving}}" bindtap="fill">应用到日期范围</button></view></view>

